从云端狠狠摔落人间，但我绝不向那权贵低头。既然长安不留我，那这天下，我也便不留了。不炼金丹不坐禅，不依权贵不尊贤。闲来写就青山卖，不使人间造孽钱。我卖山水，我卖清风，卖我这一身的八斗高才。桃花坞里桃花庵，桃花庵下桃花仙。桃花仙人种桃树，又折花枝当酒钱。我终日与花为伍，与酒为伴。别人笑我太疯癫，我笑他人看不穿。不见五陵豪杰墓，无花无酒锄作田。半醒半醉之间，我看透这腌臜世界生在阳间有散场，死归地府也何妨。我笑，我大笑，笑尽这世间荒唐。百年之后，谁还不是荒冢一堆？仙境也好，地府也罢，有甚区别？我是唐寅，这支笔，这最后一点傲气，我终守了一辈子。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "输入文本", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "model", "links": [54], "label": "model", "type": "MELROFORMERMODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "size": [441.272705078125, 124.95278930664062], "pos": [1892.5787353515625, 935.9085083007812], "widgets_values": ["MelBandRoFormer_comfy/MelBandRoformer_fp16.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 40, "type": "MelBandRoFormerModelLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-MelBandRoFormer", "ver": "b68d9077815387b64d596f8c39607052b95b6eba", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.6.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"model_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MelBandRoFormerModelLoader"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-674.0420234350094, -141.682786226905], "scale": 0.7247295000000029}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "上传音色参考音频", "bounding": [1163.3966064453125, 303.5988464355469, 693.0540771484375, 614.20361328125]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 6, "title": "上传情感参考音频", "bounding"